__EVENTS__
Events
| where EventType == 'http_summary'
| summarize Requests=sum(Count), TotalDurationMs=sum(DurationMs), MaxLatencyMs=max(MaxDurationMs)
    by bin(TimeGenerated, {TimeRange:grain})
| extend MeanLatencyMs=TotalDurationMs / Requests
| project TimeGenerated, MeanLatencyMs, MaxLatencyMs
| order by TimeGenerated asc
